{"sources":1125,"surfaces":3652,"risk_candidates":[{"file":"packages/daemon-core/src/daemon/HandshakeManager.ts","line":202,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`Handshake file deleted: ${handshakeFile}`","owner":"removeHandshake"},{"file":"scripts/lib/daemon-http-reference.ts","line":30,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`# Current Daemon HTTP routes\\n\\nDerived from [HTTPServer](../src/http/HTTPServer.ts) and the controlled HTTP tool registry. Regenerate with \\`bun scripts/render-daemon-http-reference.ts\\`; check with \\`--check\\`. Product authority remains [SPS](../../../docs/product-specification/specforge-product-specification.md).\\n","owner":"renderDaemonHttpReferences"},{"file":"scripts/lib/opencode_merge.ts","line":379,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`跳过 Agent \"${name}\": 不在 managed_agents 中，可能是用户自定义。使用 --force 覆盖`","owner":"mergeOpenCodeJsonUserLevel"},{"file":"scripts/lib/verify.ts","line":396,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`   建议: 执行 \\`upgrade --force\\` 恢复共享组件到预期状态`","owner":"printVerifyReport"},{"file":"scripts/scan-host-profile.ts","line":71,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`\nHost Profile 扫描器 — 探测宿主机环境并写入 <OpenCode config>/sf-user/host-profile.json\n\n用法:\n  bun run scripts/scan-host-profile.ts [选项]\n\n选项:\n  --force, -f       强制重新扫描，忽略 30 天缓存\n  --show, -s        显示当前档案（不扫描）\n  --check           CI 模式：扫描后输出 JSON 摘要到 stdout\n  --quiet, -q       静默模式（不打印进度）\n  --help, -h        显示本帮助\n\n档案位置:\n  ${getH","owner":"showHelp"},{"file":"scripts/sf-installer.ts","line":111,"kind":"LITERAL_REVIEW_CANDIDATE","expression":"`\nSpecForge 安装器 — 用户级共享组件管理\n\n用法:\n  bun scripts/sf-installer.ts <subcommand> [options]\n\n子命令:\n  install           部署共享组件到 OpenCode 配置目录\n  upgrade           原子升级共享组件\n  verify            校验共享组件完整性（SHA-256）\n  uninstall         卸载共享组件\n\n选项:\n  --force     upgrade 时强制覆盖所有文件\n  --version   显示已安装的 SpecForge 版本\n  --help, -h  显示此帮助信","owner":"showUsage"}]}
